## 💾 Tallennuslogiikka

### Cover Letter Save Flow
```
1. FRONTEND (edit-cover-letter/page.tsx)
   ├─ Käyttäjä klikkaa "Tallenna"
   ├─ Kerää data: content, ai_data, style settings
   └─ POST /api/cover-letters/[id]
         ├─ Headers: Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
         └─ Body: { content: {...}, ai_data: {...} }

2. MIDDLEWARE (middleware.ts)
   ├─ Tarkistaa: req.headers.get('authorization')
   ├─ Jos puuttuu → 401 Unauthorized
   └─ Jos OK → next()

3. API ROUTE (/api/cover-letters/[id]/route.ts)
   ├─ Dekoodaa JWT token:
   │  ├─ token.split('.')[1] → Base64 payload
   │  ├─ Buffer.from(payload, 'base64')
   │  └─ payload.sub → Clerk User ID
   │
   ├─ Supabase query:
   │  await supabase
   │    .from('cover_letters')
   │    .update({ content, ai_data })
   │    .eq('id', letterId)
   │    .eq('user_id', clerkUserId) // ✅ SECURITY!
   │
   └─ Return: 200 OK + updated letter

4. SUPABASE
   ├─ RLS: DISABLED (yksinkertaisempi)
   ├─ Security: Backend enforced (.eq('user_id'))
   └─ Table: cover_letters
        ├─ id (uuid)
        ├─ user_id (text, Clerk ID)
        ├─ content (jsonb)
        ├─ ai_data (jsonb)
        └─ created_at, updated_at
Miksi ei RLS?

✅ Yksinkertaisempi: Ei tarvitse syncata Clerk → Supabase
✅ Toimii JWT:n kanssa: Clerk JWT ei automaattisesti toimi Supabase RLS:n kanssa
✅ Backend enforcement: API route tarkistaa user_id
✅ Sama turvallisuus: .eq('user_id', clerkUserId) jokaisessa kyselyssä

Data Structure
typescript// cover_letters table
{
  id: "uuid",
  user_id: "user_2abc...", // Clerk User ID
  title: "Hakukirje - Accenture",
  language: "finnish",
  
  content: {
    // 🔒 PRIVACY: Stored separately, not sent to AI
    contactInfo: {
      name: "Ville Skog",
      email: "vipsu@protonmail.com",
      phone: "044 9890687",
      location: "Helsinki, Finland"
    },
    
    // ✅ Body (generated by AI, no personal data)
    body: "Hei,\n\nOlen innostunut...",
    
    // ✅ Signature (editable)
    signature: "Ville Skog",
    
    // ✅ Style settings
    headerColor: "rgb(181, 152, 79)",
    headerLayout: "top",
    sidebarContent: "contact",
    
    // Job context
    job_title: "Fullstack Developer",
    company_name: "Accenture",
    job_description: "We are looking for..."
  },
  
  ai_data: {
    // AI-generated data (backup)
    style: "professional",
    key_highlights: ["React", "TypeScript"],
    type: "ats-v2",
    
    // ATS-specific (if applicable)
    ats_score: 85,
    ats_analysis: {
      keywordMatch: 85,
      exactMatches: ["React", "TypeScript"],
      missing: ["Docker"]
    },
    
    // RAG usage
    rag_used: true,
    
    // Guardian validation
    guardian_report: {
      approved: true,
      riskLevel: "safe"
    }
  },
  
  created_at: "2026-02-02T10:00:00Z",
  updated_at: "2026-02-02T10:30:00Z"
}
```

