## 🔒 Privacy & Security

### Privacy Layers
```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ LAYER 1: Frontend Collection                        │
│ ✅ Collects: name, email, phone, location          │
│ ✅ Stores: Supabase (user_id checked)              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ LAYER 2: AI Prompt (PRIVACY WALL)                   │
│ ❌ NEVER sent to AI:                                │
│    - Full name                                       │
│    - Email address                                   │
│    - Phone number                                    │
│    - Home address                                    │
│                                                      │
│ ✅ Sent to AI (anonymized):                         │
│    - Work experience (without company names if PII) │
│    - Skills                                          │
│    - Education                                       │
│    - Personality traits                              │
│    - Stories (anonymized)                            │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ LAYER 3: Template Assembly                          │
│ ✅ AI generates body text (no personal data)       │
│ ✅ Template adds:                                    │
│    - Name (from content.contactInfo.name)           │
│    - Email (from content.contactInfo.email)         │
│    - Phone (from content.contactInfo.phone)         │
│    - Signature                                       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Security Checklist

- [x] **Middleware:** Tarkistaa Authorization header
- [x] **JWT decode:** Ekstraktoi Clerk User ID
- [x] **user_id check:** Jokaisessa Supabase kyselyssä
- [x] **NO RLS:** Backend enforced security (yksinkertaisempi)
- [x] **Privacy prompts:** AI ei koskaan saa henkilötietoja
- [x] **CORS:** Next.js default CORS (same-origin)
- [x] **Rate limiting:** Voidaan lisätä tarvittaessa (Vercel Edge)
- [x] **Input validation:** Zod schemas API routeissa

